    },
    {
      "statement": "By applying Temporal-Difference (TD) learning to POMDP-generated superstate transitions and targeting the Bellman fixed point of the superstate MDP, we prove a finite-time critic error bound with nonlinear neural value function approximation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Combining the neural critic function approximation error bound with the policy mirror descent framework, we obtain a finite-time sublinear regret against the optimal POMDP value.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
